{"3268370": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Tenkemo", "steam_appid": 3268370, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3268370/extras/e1fba81b9d844f1b366eaaed887a0bf6.poster.avif?t=1759617875\" width=600 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3268370/extras/e1fba81b9d844f1b366eaaed887a0bf6.webm?t=1759617875\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3268370/extras/e1fba81b9d844f1b366eaaed887a0bf6.mp4?t=1759617875\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tenkemo</strong> is a <strong>cozy</strong> <strong>multiplayer</strong> <strong>open-world</strong> game packed with fun and adventure! Whether you're playing solo or with friends, explore a huge world where you can gather resources, craft tools, and build anything from homes to factories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore forests, caves, and mountains, and experience cool weather changes and a day-night cycle. Your mission? Rescue and collect cute animals, then team up with them to protect their kingdom from AI bots trying to take over!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3268370/extras/a98ef1711f51472837d9e43f674e3917.poster.avif?t=1759617875\" width=600 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3268370/extras/a98ef1711f51472837d9e43f674e3917.webm?t=1759617875\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3268370/extras/a98ef1711f51472837d9e43f674e3917.mp4?t=1759617875\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >·\tPlay solo or with friends</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >·\tExplore a massive open world full of caves, forests, and mountains</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >·\tWeather system with day-night cycle</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >·\tGather resources and mine for materials</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >·\tCraft tools and build homes, factories, and more</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >·\tCollect adorable animals and fight alongside them</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >·\tCustomize your character</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3268370/extras/71b80dfd8e38860fa9e5ddce0554cd56.poster.avif?t=1759617875\" width=600 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3268370/extras/71b80dfd8e38860fa9e5ddce0554cd56.webm?t=1759617875\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3268370/extras/71b80dfd8e38860fa9e5ddce0554cd56.mp4?t=1759617875\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We’re still working on the game, so hop into our Discord (<u>link on the right side of this page</u>) to share your ideas and help shape <i>Tenkemo</i>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wishlist now and stay tuned!</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3268370/extras/e1fba81b9d844f1b366eaaed887a0bf6.poster.avif?t=1759617875\" width=600 height=192 ><sou